### A.1 Skill Detection Flow

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    SKILL DETECTION FLOW                             │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                     │
│  1. REQUEST PARSING                                                 │
│     └── Extract keywords, intent signals, domain context           │
│                                                                     │
│  2. SKILL MATCHING                                                  │
│     └── Match against [[skill-registry]] §2 Trigger Matrix         │
│                                                                     │
│  3. CONFIDENCE SCORING                                              │
│     └── Calculate scores using §3 thresholds                         │
│                                                                     │
│  4. SKILL ACTIVATION                                                │
│     ├── Primary skill selected                                      │
│     ├── Secondary skills identified                                 │
│     ├── karpathy-coding (MANDATORY OVERLAY)                        │
│     └── Gates determined from §5                                    │
│                                                                     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

