### A.5 Context Signals (Beyond Keywords)

Ngoài keywords, các context signals sau được sử dụng để refine skill selection:

#### A.5.1 Implicit Signals

```yaml
# Signal → Skill Inference Mapping

Signal: "file extension in request"
  - .vue, .tsx, .jsx → frontend-taste/frontend-redesign
  - .py, .java, .go → backend (no frontend skill)

Signal: "design system mentioned"
  - Tailwind, shadcn, Radix → frontend-taste
  - Fluent UI, Material → frontend-taste (official design system)

Signal: "existing codebase reference"
  - "current app", "existing site" → frontend-redesign
  - "our website" → frontend-redesign
  - "new project", "from scratch" → frontend-taste + full-output

Signal: "quality/standard language"
  - "enterprise", "production-ready" → full-output + frontend-review
  - "shippable", "ready to deploy" → full-output

Signal: "visual/aesthetic language"
  - "beautiful", "premium", "polished" → frontend-taste
  - "ugly", "outdated" → frontend-redesign
  - "modern", "sleek" → frontend-redesign

Signal: "security language"
  - "protect", "secure", "encrypt" → security-review
  - "leak", "breach", "vulnerable" → security-review
```

#### A.5.2 Anti-Signals (Skills to NOT Apply)

```yaml
# Negative Signals → Skill Exclusion

Signal: "backend only" → Exclude frontend skills
  - "API only", "REST endpoint", "database migration"
  
Signal: "infrastructure" → Exclude frontend/security skills
  - "docker", "kubernetes", "CI/CD", "deployment"
  
Signal: "pure logic" → Exclude frontend-taste
  - "algorithm", "data processing", "computation"
  
Signal: "documentation" → Exclude frontend skills
  - "write docs", "API documentation", "README"
```

### A.6 Skill Detection Decision Tree

```
START: Request Received
│
├── Is request about PAYMENT (MoMo, SePay, PayOS, ZaloPay, VNPay, VietQR)?
│   └── YES → Is request about SECURITY (vulnerability, auth, secrets)?
│       ├── YES → security-review + vietnam-payment-review
│       └── NO → vietnam-payment-review + [security-review if auth/payment]
│
├── Is request about SECURITY (vulnerability, pentest, OWASP, CVE, etc.)?
│   └── YES → security-review
│       └── Is task APK/binary RE?
│           ├── YES → security-review + reverse-skill routing
│           └── NO → security-review standalone
│
├── Is request about FRONTEND (UI, landing, redesign, component)?
│   ├── YES → Is request about REDESIGN (existing site, improve, upgrade)?
│   │   ├── YES → frontend-redesign + full-output + frontend-review
│   │   └── NO → Is request about BUILD/CREATE (landing, portfolio, new)?
│   │       ├── YES → frontend-taste + full-output + frontend-review
│   │       └── NO → Is request about REVIEW (quality check, audit)?
│   │           ├── YES → frontend-review (standalone)
│   │           └── NO → frontend-taste + frontend-review
│   └── NO → Is request about FULL OUTPUT (full implementation, complete)?
│       ├── YES → full-output + [domain-specific review]
│       └── NO → Apply default based on implicit signals
│
└── Is request AMBIGUOUS (low confidence for all skills)?
    └── YES → Ask clarifying question, then apply based on response
```

