### Bước 0: SKILL DETECTION (Auto-Discovery)

**TRƯỚC KHI bất kỳ pre-review nào, luôn chạy Skill Detection Engine:**

```
Khi nhận request:
1. Parse request → extract keywords, intent signals, domain context
2. Match against Skill Keyword Matrix (Section A.2)
3. Calculate confidence scores (Section A.3)
4. Determine skill combination (Section A.4)
5. Check context signals (Section A.5)
6. Apply decision tree (Section A.6)
7. Output: Skills Selected + Review Gates to Run
8. Load SKILL.md files cho tất cả selected skills
```

